From 18877aa6ee4a06b0cf5de1bccf710bde5d1a5e9c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hectorqin <14220132+hectorqin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:00:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 05/13] fix(plugins): harden the tool-renderer lifecycle

- give each renderTool call its own mount node, so a renderer that
  finishes late can neither write into nor clear its replacement
- reset to the host rendering while a replacement renderer loads
- release the renderer and show the host rendering when update() throws
- push an update when the selected project changes
- drop a plugin's cached renderer module after it is updated or
  uninstalled, and remount when its version changes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
